    "body": "fix on issue/1609-circular-ramp-angle · PR #1663 · pinned by circular_ramp_angle (a_ramp_entry_circular_never_descends_steeper_than_its_ramp_angle, every_ring_level_of_the_ramp_entry_is_entered_by_the_ramp) · merges when reviewed. Cause: the Ramp arm posted the legacy chord. A ring ends at its own start, so the chord had no length at each level change. Fix: on the circular kernel, the Ramp arm rides the ring at the ramp angle (3 deg). A ring too short for it dives at the plunge feed, with a note. No golden moves.",
